 comming soon. \nBut what can you do in the game?\n\n. Climb trees\n. swim\n. play horror\n. hang out\n. have fun\n\nEvery month new cosmetics.\nPlay the game at its release and get special items.", "short_description": "Sphere Runners. Take your friends and play. You can swim, climb trees and many other things. Get daily rewards and buy cosmetics."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://abbibre090.wixsite.com/sphererunners/private-policiy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "KaboomStudio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://abbibre090.wixsite.com/sphererunners", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "CO_OP", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "166199496451470"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031396_271772975229756_4415590158925162490_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LE9TgDfc4RYQ7kNvwHq8j86&_nc_oc=Adrnvn8e2RDzOjQz8z9je6sepFjvXfXbnWgSGriRWb6d8Hx5wpxE12IzNfsfFt1dFJ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0mSf287G4_bloOIvLbUv8OfE1N7oUKsCgo0EfazHHi9Q&oe=69E24CD3"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Sphere Runners", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "release_date": 1688071651, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "6358088957562759", "release_type": "SCHE